From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: macbox <macbox@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 02:23:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/25] a boot test of coherent pages through
 NVMe DMA

dma.c swaps through QEMU's NVMe controller over pages armed, held, frozen, stale
and plain, under rvg_coherent_rehearse, and checks every word; run-dma.sh fails
one that reached no such page. coherent_test.c gets the stale page that crashed
the VM.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
